{% doc %}
  @prompt
    ✨ FULL CHRISTMAS WEBSITE DESIGN PROMPT (5-SECTION) 🎄
    
    Prompt:
    Create a premium, festive, Christmas-themed webpage layout with 5 clean and modern sections, using a cozy holiday design style. The overall theme should include soft snow textures, glowing fairy lights, red-green-gold color accents, and elegant typography. The layout should feel warm, luxury, and joyful.
    
    Section 1: Christmas Hero Banner
    
    A full-width Christmas banner at the top.
    
    Background elements: falling snowflakes, pine leaves, warm fairy lights, ornaments, and a soft golden glow.
    
    In the center, add a smooth moving text animation scrolling left to right saying:
    “🎄 Celebrating the Season of Joy — Christmas Sale Live Now! 🎁”
    
    Add a main bold heading:
    “Merry Christmas and Happy Shopping!”
    
    Add a CTA button:
    “Shop Christmas Collection”
    
    Section 2: Product Showcase in Unique Style
    
    Display products in a creative festive design layout.
    
    Use snow-covered product frames, gift-style borders, or hanging ornaments layout.
    
    Each product should have:
    
    Small snowflake hover effect
    
    A red ribbon tag for price or discount
    
    A small gold star rating under each item
    
    Section 3: Limited-Time Christmas Offer
    
    Add an attractive countdown timer styled like a glowing Christmas ornament.
    
    Text:
    “Exclusive Christmas Deals Ending Soon!”
    
    Highlight discount badges like:
    
    ❄️ 20% OFF
    
    🎁 Buy 1 Get 1
    
    ⭐ Special Holiday Bundle
    
    Section 4: Customer Review Section in Christmas Theme
    
    Design this area like a Christmas postcard or gift tag board.
    
    Add customer reviews in cute Christmas frames with icons like bells, stockings, holly leaves.
    
    Example review format:
    
    ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
    “Absolutely loved it! Perfect gift for the holidays!” — Sarah J. 🎄
    
    Optional: Add animated blinking fairy lights around the border.
    
    Section 5: Footer With Christmas Vibes
    
    Use warm cozy colors and icons like reindeer, candy canes, gingerbread, or Santa hat.
    
    Add:
    
    Contact details
    
    Social icons styled as ornaments
    
    Newsletter subscription box saying:
    “Subscribe & , Create a premium Christmas sale banner in a warm festive style. Include a cozy winter background with soft falling snow, pine leaves, golden fairy lights, red and green ornaments, and glowing Christmas decorations. Add a beautiful Christmas tree on one side and gift boxes with ribbons on the other side. In the center, place elegant bold text: "Christmas Sale 🎄 Up to 50% Off" with a golden sparkling effect. Add a glowing red CTA button that says: "Shop Now". Make the design clean, modern, and luxurious with warm lighting, soft shadows, and high detail. Use a landscape ratio, 1920x600. --v 6 --ar 16:5 --style festive
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-xmas-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 600px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.bg_gradient_1 }} 0%, {{ block.settings.bg_gradient_2 }} 50%, {{ block.settings.bg_gradient_3 }} 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.2) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-snow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-xmas-snowflake-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    color: {{ block.settings.snow_color }};
    opacity: 0.8;
    animation: ai-xmas-fall-{{ ai_gen_id }} linear infinite;
    text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  @keyframes ai-xmas-fall-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      transform: translateY(-50px) rotate(0deg);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    10% {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    90% {
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateY(650px) rotate(360deg);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-lights-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-xmas-light-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: ai-xmas-twinkle-{{ ai_gen_id }} 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px currentColor, 0 0 20px currentColor;
  }

  @keyframes ai-xmas-twinkle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      opacity: 0.4;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1.2);
    }
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-tree-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: {{ block.settings.tree_position }}px;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 300px;
    height: 500px;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 60px solid transparent;
    border-right: 60px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 100px solid {{ block.settings.tree_color }};
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) {
    bottom: 300px;
    border-left-width: 40px;
    border-right-width: 40px;
    border-bottom-width: 80px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
    bottom: 200px;
    border-left-width: 70px;
    border-right-width: 70px;
    border-bottom-width: 120px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
    bottom: 80px;
    border-left-width: 90px;
    border-right-width: 90px;
    border-bottom-width: 140px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-trunk-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 30px;
    height: 80px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.trunk_color }};
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-tree-ornament-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: ai-xmas-ornament-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-xmas-ornament-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 5px currentColor;
    }
    50% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px currentColor, 0 0 25px currentColor;
    }
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-gifts-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    right: {{ block.settings.gifts_position }}px;
    bottom: 50px;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.gift_color_1 }};
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.gift_color_2 }};
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
    width: 70px;
    height: 70px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.gift_color_3 }};
    align-self: flex-end;
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-v-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 15px;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.ribbon_color }};
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-h-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 0;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 100%;
    height: 15px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.ribbon_color }};
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 30px;
    height: 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.ribbon_color }};
    border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before,
  .ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    width: 15px;
    height: 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.ribbon_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    left: -12px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    right: -12px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 4;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 900px;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    text-shadow: 
      0 0 10px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
      0 0 20px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
      0 0 30px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
      2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    line-height: 1.2;
    animation: ai-xmas-title-sparkle-{{ ai_gen_id }} 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-xmas-title-sparkle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      text-shadow: 
        0 0 10px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        0 0 20px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        0 0 30px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    50% {
      text-shadow: 
        0 0 20px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        0 0 30px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        0 0 40px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        0 0 50px {{ block.settings.title_glow }},
        2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_v }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_h }}px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.button_bg_1 }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_bg_2 }} 100%);
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 
      0 0 20px {{ block.settings.button_glow }},
      0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    animation: ai-xmas-button-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes ai-xmas-button-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      box-shadow: 
        0 0 20px {{ block.settings.button_glow }},
        0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      box-shadow: 
        0 0 30px {{ block.settings.button_glow }},
        0 0 40px {{ block.settings.button_glow }},
        0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  }

  .ai-xmas-banner-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 
      0 0 40px {{ block.settings.button_glow }},
      0 0 60px {{ block.settings.button_glow }},
      0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  .ai-xmas-pine-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    color: {{ block.settings.pine_color }};
    font-size: 40px;
    opacity: 0.6;
    z-index: 2;
    filter: drop-shadow(2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1200px) {
    .ai-xmas-banner-tree-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 200px;
      height: 350px;
      left: 20px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-banner-gifts-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      right: 20px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      width: 75px;
      height: 75px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-xmas-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 400px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-banner-tree-left-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-xmas-banner-gifts-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-xmas-banner-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-banner-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-xmas-banner-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_v | times: 0.8 }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_h | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-xmas-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-xmas-banner-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

  <div class="ai-xmas-banner-snow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..30) %}
      {% assign left = forloop.index | times: 3.3 | modulo: 100 %}
      {% assign delay = forloop.index | times: 0.3 %}
      {% assign duration = forloop.index | modulo: 4 | plus: 8 %}
      {% assign size = forloop.index | modulo: 3 | plus: 1 %}
      {% if size == 1 %}
        {% assign font_size = 14 %}
      {% elsif size == 2 %}
        {% assign font_size = 18 %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign font_size = 22 %}
      {% endif %}
      <div 
        class="ai-xmas-snowflake-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        style="left: {{ left }}%; font-size: {{ font_size }}px; animation-delay: {{ delay }}s; animation-duration: {{ duration }}s;"
      >❄</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="ai-xmas-banner-lights-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..20) %}
      {% assign left = forloop.index | times: 5 | modulo: 100 %}
      {% assign top = forloop.index | times: 7 | modulo: 100 %}
      {% assign delay = forloop.index | times: 0.2 %}
      {% assign color_index = forloop.index | modulo: 3 %}
      {% if color_index == 0 %}
        {% assign light_color = block.settings.light_color_1 %}
      {% elsif color_index == 1 %}
        {% assign light_color = block.settings.light_color_2 %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign light_color = block.settings.light_color_3 %}
      {% endif %}
      <div 
        class="ai-xmas-light-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        style="left: {{ left }}%; top: {{ top }}%; color: {{ light_color }}; animation-delay: {{ delay }}s;"
      ></div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% for i in (1..8) %}
    {% assign left = forloop.index | times: 12 | modulo: 100 %}
    {% assign top = forloop.index | times: 15 | modulo: 80 %}
    {% assign rotation = forloop.index | times: 45 %}
    <div 
      class="ai-xmas-pine-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
      style="left: {{ left }}%; top: {{ top }}%; transform: rotate({{ rotation }}deg);"
    >🌿</div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="ai-xmas-banner-tree-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-xmas-tree-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-tree-layer-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-tree-trunk-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      
      {% for i in (1..12) %}
        {% assign ornament_left = forloop.index | times: 15 | modulo: 80 | plus: 10 %}
        {% assign ornament_top = forloop.index | times: 30 | modulo: 350 | plus: 50 %}
        {% assign delay = forloop.index | times: 0.3 %}
        {% assign color_index = forloop.index | modulo: 3 %}
        {% if color_index == 0 %}
          {% assign ornament_color = block.settings.ornament_color_1 %}
        {% elsif color_index == 1 %}
          {% assign ornament_color = block.settings.ornament_color_2 %}
        {% else %}
          {% assign ornament_color = block.settings.ornament_color_3 %}
        {% endif %}
        <div 
          class="ai-xmas-tree-ornament-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          style="left: {{ ornament_left }}%; top: {{ ornament_top }}px; background-color: {{ ornament_color }}; animation-delay: {{ delay }}s;"
        ></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-xmas-banner-gifts-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-v-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-h-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-v-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-h-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-xmas-gift-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-v-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-ribbon-h-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-xmas-gift-bow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-xmas-banner-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <h1 class="ai-xmas-banner-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.banner_title }}</h1>
    {% if block.settings.banner_subtitle != blank %}
      <p class="ai-xmas-banner-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.banner_subtitle }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_link }}" class="ai-xmas-banner-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {{ block.settings.cta_text }}
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Christmas sale banner",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Banner content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "banner_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Christmas Sale 🎄 Up to 50% Off"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "banner_subtitle",
      "label": "Subtitle"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "title_size",
      "min": 32,
      "max": 96,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Title size",
      "default": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "subtitle_size",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Subtitle size",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "title_color",
      "label": "Title color",
      "default": "#FFD700"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "title_glow",
      "label": "Title glow color",
      "default": "#FFA500"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "subtitle_color",
      "label": "Subtitle color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Call to action button"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "Shop Now"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_text_size",
      "min": 14,
      "max": 28,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Button text size",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_padding_v",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Button vertical padding",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_padding_h",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Button horizontal padding",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "button_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Button border radius",
      "default": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_bg_1",
      "label": "Button gradient start",
      "default": "#c41e3a"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_bg_2",
      "label": "Button gradient end",
      "default": "#8b0000"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_text_color",
      "label": "Button text color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_glow",
      "label": "Button glow color",
      "default": "rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.6)"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_gradient_1",
      "label": "Background gradient start",
      "default": "#0f3d2c"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_gradient_2",
      "label": "Background gradient middle",
      "default": "#1a5c42"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
